This project implements Figma-style corner smoothing using the mathematical
construction publicly described by Figma:

  "Desperately seeking squircles" by Daniel Furse
  https://www.figma.com/blog/desperately-seeking-squircles/

The following MIT-licensed projects were studied as references:

  MartinRGB/Figma_Squircles_Approximation
  Copyright (c) MartinRGB
  https://github.com/MartinRGB/Figma_Squircles_Approximation

  phamfoo/figma-squircle
  Copyright (c) Tien Pham
  https://github.com/phamfoo/figma-squircle

No code from either package is included as a runtime dependency.
